For modules to work under 2.6, you'll need new 'module-init-tools'.
Download the latest from:
	http://tinyurl.com/2nszp

You'll also need new 'top' and 'vmstat' utilities. These can be
had from http://procps.sourceforge.net.

Don't count on initrd to work. Build all important drivers into the
kernel for now.

Regards,
John

